sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>(llm-d-inference-gateway)
    participant API as API Server<br/>8000/TCP (optional TLS)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>TCP
    participant Redis as Redis/Valkey<br/>TCP
    participant Processor as Batch Processor
    participant FileStore as File Store<br/>(PVC or S3)
    participant LLMd as llm-d Inference<br/>Gateway
    participant GC as Garbage Collector
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over Client, OTel: Flow 1: Batch Job Submission
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/batches<br/>Authorization: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>API: Forward request<br/>(auth enforced at gateway)
    API->>API: Middleware: Recovery → RequestMiddleware<br/>(X-MaaS-Username tenant, OTel trace, metrics)
    API->>FileStore: Store input file<br/>(if inline data)
    API->>PG: Persist job metadata<br/>(status: pending)
    API->>Redis: Enqueue job<br/>(llm-d-async producer)
    API-->>Gateway: 202 Accepted<br/>{batch_id, status: pending}
    Gateway-->>Client: 202 Accepted

    Note over Client, OTel: Flow 2: File Upload
    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/files<br/>multipart/form-data (max 200MB)
    Gateway->>API: Forward upload
    API->>FileStore: Store file<br/>(PVC or S3)
    API->>PG: Record file metadata<br/>(expiry: 90 days)
    API-->>Gateway: 200 OK {file_id}
    Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client, OTel: Flow 3: Batch Job Processing
    Processor->>Redis: Poll for pending jobs
    Redis-->>Processor: Job payload
    Processor->>PG: Update status: processing
    Processor->>FileStore: Retrieve input file
    FileStore-->>Processor: Input data
    Processor->>LLMd: POST inference request<br/>Authorization header passthrough
    LLMd-->>Processor: Inference result
    Processor->>FileStore: Write output file
    Processor->>PG: Update status: completed

    Note over Client, OTel: Flow 4: Garbage Collection
    GC->>PG: Scan for expired jobs/files
    PG-->>GC: Expired records
    GC->>FileStore: Delete expired files
    GC->>PG: Remove expired records

    Note over Client, OTel: Flow 5: Observability (all components)
    API->>OTel: Export traces (OTLP/gRPC)
    Processor->>OTel: Export traces (OTLP/gRPC)
    GC->>OTel: Export traces (OTLP/gRPC)
    Note right of API: Prometheus metrics on :8081/metrics<br/>Health checks on :8081/health
